     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>In the MRE below, I want to plot the triangle (from addPolygons) beneath the circles (from addCircleMarkers) in order to use a popup when the user clicks a circle.  </div><div><br></div><div>In the standalone plot, the ordering of arguments accomplishes this:</div><div><br></div><div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">    leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addTiles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addPolygons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></div></code></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><b>The Problem</b></div><div>I&#39;ve additionally added the ability to toggle the shape via leafletProxy, but doing so always puts the polygon over the drawn circles, even if I order the plotting as above.</div><div><br></div><div>How can I ensure that the circles are always drawn on top?</div><div><br></div><div>Any help is appreciated.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>The MRE:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>stuttgart </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">49.340052</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">49.400860</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">48.029136</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lng </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">8.011806</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10.923183</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9.195583</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  leafletOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mymap&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  checkboxInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;show&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Show Stuttgart Triangle&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  points </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eventReactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$recalc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    cbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rnorm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">48.79</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ignoreNULL </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Base plot</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$mymap </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderLeaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      addTiles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      addPolygons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stuttgart$lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lng </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stuttgart$lng</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;#FFBF00&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layerId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stuttgart&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> points</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> popup </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Here!&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Takes away the polygon</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$show</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$show </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      leafletProxy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mymap&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>       removeShape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          layerId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stuttgart&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### Puts the polygon  back</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$show</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$show </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      leafletProxy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;mymap&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        addPolygons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stuttgart$lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lng </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stuttgart$lng</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> color </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;#FFBF00&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layerId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;stuttgart&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     addCircleMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> points</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> popup </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Here!&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
